3. COST MODEL
==============================================================================
d=768  F=1152  22 layers = 8 full + 14 sliding (w=64)  head_layers=2

      n      total FLOPs  ratio vs n=1024  encoder q share   head q share
     61       1.0539e+09            0.032            20.4%           1.1%
    512       1.2393e+10            0.377            37.5%           6.5%
   1024       3.2838e+10            1.000            47.9%           9.8%
   2048       9.7889e+10            2.981            58.5%          13.2%
   3006       1.8791e+11            5.722            63.5%          14.8%
   3972       3.0723e+11            9.356            66.7%          15.8%
   4938       4.5522e+11           13.863            68.8%          16.5%
   5946       6.4021e+11           19.496            70.4%          17.0%
   6912       8.4678e+11           25.786            71.6%          17.3%
   8192       1.1646e+12           35.466            72.8%          17.7%

MODELLED  FLOPs(8192)/FLOPs(1024) = 35.466x
MODELLED  FLOPs(5946)/FLOPs(1024) = 19.496x
MODELLED  FLOPs(7000)/FLOPs(1024) = 26.403x
closed form: ratio = (b*n8 + c_head*n8^2) / (b*n0 + c_head*n0^2),
  b = 2*8*768 + 2*14*129*768 + 17*768^2 + 4*768*1152 = 16,352,256
  c_head = 2*head_layers*d = 3,072  (the DECISION HEAD's own 2 self-attention
  layers are quadratic in n too - the head is forward()ed over the whole sequence)
  = (16352256*8192 + 3072*8192^2) / (16352256*1024 + 3072*1024^2) = 17.035

BOUND: modelled ratio = 35.466x. In the family lat-proportional-to-FLOPs with
  a fixed linear coefficient b = 16,352,256 and a variable quadratic coefficient c >= 0,
  the ratio (b*8192 + c*8192^2)/(b*1024 + c*1024^2) increases monotonically in c and
  tends to (8192/1024)^2 = 64.0x from below. So the SUPREMUM is exactly 64x and the
  headline 219x is UNREACHABLE for any number of global layers, hidden size, or head
  width - 219 > 64. The only way to see 219x is if the measured cost is not FLOPs-
  proportional, which the section-4 comparison tests.
    c =        3,072  -> ratio  17.035x
    c =       30,720  -> ratio  44.846x
    c =      307,200  -> ratio  61.233x
    c =    1,000,000  -> ratio  63.120x

